atorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x)}{x-1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis time, the resulting limit still gives the indeterminate form $\\frac{0}{0}.$ To find the limit, we apply L'Hopital's rule once again. We get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to 1}\\frac{2+2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x)}{{x}^{2}-2x+1} & =-{lim}_{x\\to 1}\\frac{\\pi \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x)}{x-1} \\\\  & =-{lim}_{x\\to 1}\\frac{[\\pi \\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\pi x)]^{′}}{[x-1]^{′}} \\\\  & =-{lim}_{x\\to 1}\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi x)}{1} \\\\  & =-{\\pi }^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\pi  \\\\  & ={\\pi }^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264171 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264172 13194139533894 true] [17592186264171 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264173 13194139533894 true] [17592186264171 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264174 13194139533894 true] [17592186264171 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264175 13194139533894 true] [17592186264171 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264176 13194139533894 true] [17592186264171 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533894 true] [17592186264171 1041 "selection" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264171 1104 #edb/ref 17592186264176 13194139533894 true] [17592186264171 1110 #uuid "dbf03e82-4adc-5a2b-a301-257c99585aae" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264172 1034 "-{\\pi }^{2}" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264172 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533894 true] [17592186264172 1111 #uuid "e2588752-2571-5af5-8f1c-40164f54d92f" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264173 1034 "-\\frac{\\pi }{2}" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264173 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533894 true] [17592186264173 1111 #uuid "f4eea8a1-99b2-5df2-8aa9-4b7be41bed25" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264174 1034 "2{\\pi }^{2}" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264174 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533894 true] [17592186264174 1111 #uuid "e6ea63fd-2ec6-533e-bc77-e0ee6d142100" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264175 1034 "\\frac{{\\pi }^{2}}{2}" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264175 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533894 true] [17592