x\\to {\\frac{\\pi }{2}}^{-}}{sin}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =-{sin}^{2}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2}) \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264178 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264179 13194139533894 true] [17592186264178 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264180 13194139533894 true] [17592186264178 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264181 13194139533894 true] [17592186264178 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264182 13194139533894 true] [17592186264178 1000 #edb/ref 17592186264183 13194139533894 true] [17592186264178 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533894 true] [17592186264178 1041 "selection" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264178 1104 #edb/ref 17592186264183 13194139533894 true] [17592186264178 1110 #uuid "fbfb649e-94a5-5d22-bd25-8a9d0fc9807b" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264179 1034 "-\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264179 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533894 true] [17592186264179 1111 #uuid "3d858df7-bf48-5787-a254-25eef37bd904" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264180 1034 "-\\pi " 13194139533894 true] [17592186264180 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533894 true] [17592186264180 1111 #uuid "3635b4b7-dbc1-50e2-9508-07653c5eae0d" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264181 1034 "2" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264181 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533894 true] [17592186264181 1111 #uuid "449e0cd6-3877-5ca5-8136-29257943bc39" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264182 1034 "1" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264182 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533894 true] [17592186264182 1111 #uuid "a691ab8a-ab38-57ad-b326-c9142195c3c5" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264183 1034 "-1" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264183 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533894 true] [17592186264183 1111 #uuid "bab86782-d9bb-56c7-bad8-4ede4c44f9b1" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264184 1017 #edb/ref 17592186264185 13194139533894 true] [17592186264184 1089 "q-31257" 13194139533894 true] [17592186264184 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139533894 true] [17592186264184 1100 "${lim}_{x\\to \\infty }\\frac{\\sqrt{x}+4x+3}